	<string name="cardhelp_sixty_nine">Works as a 6 or a 9 of its color, and its number is 69. Jumps in on (and can be jumped on by) a 6 or 9 of its color.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_aids">When you are made to draw, split the cards with whoever made you draw (they get the odd card). On Quitter, its player is removed too; on Glasnost, both hands are shown. Not on Spreader, Ping or field cards.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_backstab">Reverses play, then the player before you draws 2. Stacks with Draw Twos.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_blue_shield">Field card. Draw attacks on you are blocked and your turn is skipped; 4 or more cards break the shield. Harvester of Sorrows breaks it and you still draw. You may stack instead.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_clone">Repeats the effect of the card below it on the next player. On a stack it adds the last card\'s amount again. Plays on anything. Not field cards or Communism.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_communism">Everyone\'s cards are pooled and shared out evenly. Field cards you are dealt come into play for you.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_conquest">Horseman, field card. On your turn you may invade a player instead of playing: both pick a number card, higher wins. Capture an army from everyone to become the Conqueror and change the color before you play.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_cure">Cures one Virus on you.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_death">Horseman. Pick a victim; the top card of the draw pile sets how many turns they have left (4 if it is not a number). At 0 they are out. Luck adds a turn, Virus takes one. Unblockable.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_delayed_blast">Skips the next player; the one after draws 4. Stacks with Draw Fours. In a duel, a plain Draw Four.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_dodge">When attacked, the attack misses you and goes to the next player. Not Harvester of Sorrows, AIDS or Spreader.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_double_skip">Skips the next two players.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_famine">Horseman. While it is out you must play whenever you can, and keep playing after plain cards. If you cannot play, draw until you can.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_ftpip">When attacked, send the attack to a player of your choice. Play continues after you unless they defend.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_fuck_you">Sends any attack back to where it started and reverses play. Plays on anything; without an attack it is a Reverse.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_gift">Give one of your other cards to a player of your choice (not your last card).</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_glasnost">Pick a player: their hand is laid out face up. Holding Quitter gets them caught.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_gold_coin">Flip a coin. Heads: draw one card per player and hand them out as you like.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_harvester">Draw 4. Unblockable, stacks with Draw Fours, breaks Blue Shields.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_holy_defender">Blocks attacks except Harvester of Sorrows, Ping, Gift, AIDS and Spreader. Whenever it is played you may remove a Horseman.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_hot_death">Draw 8. Stacks with Draw Fours and Eights.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_i_dont_like_these">Throw away your hand and draw the same number of new cards.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_luck">Field card: draw one card less every time you have to draw.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_mad">You and a player of your choice drop your hands and leave the round.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_magic_5">When attacked, takes 8 off the stack for every Hot Death in it. Plays on anything.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_martyr">You leave the round and give all your cards to a player of your choice.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_mystery_draw">Played on a 1 to 9 (or the 69), the next player draws that many cards. Otherwise a Wild.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_necromancer">Bring back a player who is out, with 8 new cards. Anyone can stop it with a Fuck You.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_penn_state">The only answer to Spreader, played for you: the Spreader\'s player draws your 2 cards instead.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_ping">A player of your choice draws exactly 1 card.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_plague">Comes into play when drawn. Everyone else draws a card after each turn until its carrier\'s next turn.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_prophet">Field card. You see a player\'s hand. Others may ask you once a turn whether that player has a card; the answer is always true. A yes on Quitter removes its holder.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_quitter">The next player is removed from the round (elimination mode: you are). Anyone caught holding it is removed.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_recycler">Reverses play. Later cards go on a new pile until a reverse card is played; then the next player draws that whole pile.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_reverse_skip">Reverses play and skips the next player.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_spreader">Everyone else draws 2 and you go again. Only Penn State stops it.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_swap">Swap hands with the player before you, then reverse play.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_taste_the_rainbow">The next player draws until they have drawn all four colors or a wild.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_chosen_one">Draw 5, keep one, the rest go back on top of the draw pile.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_flood">Washes away field cards except Death, War, Conquest, Yin and Yang. Ends the Plague.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_virus">Infect a player: they draw one extra card every time they draw, until cured.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_war">Horseman. Everyone turns up a card and may not play its color until War is gone.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_yin">Like Luck, and in play the moment you draw it. With Yang on another player you team up; with both you are immune to most attacks.</string>
	<string name="cardhelp_yang">Like Luck, and in play the moment you draw it. With Yin on another player you team up; with both you are immune to most attacks.</string>
